{"id":"fblyahkwl5t3lavo7aas23eqn","title":"口腔软硬组织再生：纳米结构材料的应用前景","originalTitle":"Biomimetics：口腔软硬组织再生：纳米结构材料的应用前景","summary":"本文构建PICO框架，采用QUIN工具评估体外研究偏倚风险，系统梳理了近5年纳米结构材料在口腔骨与软组织再生中的应用，涵盖纳米膜、水凝胶、纳米颗粒等技术路线。研究指出，尽管纳米材料在体外和动物实验中表现出良好潜力，但缺乏临床证据，提示未来需加强人体临床研究。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3516770&do=blog&id=1561565"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T05:55:27.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T12:23:31.478Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T12:23:31.478Z","category":"materials-energy","tags":["论文发表","DeepMind"],"score":35,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"adf6afa9-9db6-4abb-93cf-93724ef627ee","title":"纳米材料口腔再生研究：实验潜力与临床证据缺口"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"adf6afa9-9db6-4abb-93cf-93724ef627ee","title":"纳米材料口腔再生研究：实验潜力与临床证据缺口"}],"topics":[{"slug":"deepmind","name":"DeepMind"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fAzqUWVCb8Lc","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}